message: "If you use FracID in your research or applications, please cite it as below."
title: "FracID: Identification of Fractional-Order Dynamical Systems from Time-Series Data"
abstract: "FracID is a high-performance Python framework and interactive web application for identifying commensurate-order Caputo fractional differential equation systems from measured or synthetic time series."
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
url: "https://github.com/mdsamhussain1996/fracid"
